        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Let me start by saying that we have had 3 pools.  One in Massachusetts that we installed at our home, one in Georgia that was existing, and now one here in AZ.  All have had their own unique issues and problems.  We purchase our home here in AZ 3 years ago, knowing that the pool equipment was going to need a little love and quick.  We started by replacing the waterfall pump because it started making a noise that sounded like driving on rims with sparks streaming after you.  We didn't know anyone here in AZ where as in MA and GA we had friends of friends that at leas knew a guy that knew a guy.",
